{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And he pronounced.</b> Some say it means 'and he separated,' like אשר פי ה׳ יקבנו (which HaShem's mouth will designate [for destruction]), [referring to] those who were designated by names. And some say it is like מה אקוב ('What shall I designate?'). And the first is closer, in my opinion."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:09.741248761Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}